    92	
    93	What I learned:
    94	- A thin adapter contract keeps task CRUD logic stable while swapping between SQLite and cloud REST backends.
    95	- Runtime mode resolution works best when layered: explicit override, env mode (`LOCAL`/`CLOUD`), then platform/cloud-availability fallback.
